BESSEL FUNCTIONS OF INTEGER ORDER (p.1.27)
Col_{\nu-1}(z)+\Col_{\nu+1}(z)=\frac{2v}{z}\Col_{\nu-1}(z)-\frac{v}{z}\Col_{\nu}(z)
Col_{\nu}(z)=-\Col_{\nu+1}(z)+\frac{v}{z}\Col_{\nu}(z)
Col_{\nu}(z)=\Col_{\nu+1}(z)+\frac{v}{z}\Col_{\nu}(z)
Col_{\nu}(0)=\Col_{\nu-1}(0)+\frac{v}{z}\Col_{\nu}(0)
Col_{\nu}(1)=\frac{1}{2}\Col_{\nu-1}(0)+\frac{v}{2}\Col_{\nu}(1)
